      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `b28f7ac2a9d8a3fd39a413e6d38b8fea0c3a262cc4469f724bb2a7db176bf92a--criminal-courts-2021-22-cube-2-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2021\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 6 of 6\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | b86b941fd50ed87bc0df68c97b0e1680f68a95c146d4227842b0dcc9163570b6 | missing |\n| \"Table 7\" | 5c08969c6df8f8bd736b684fbed6c50bbc8d8e7d23799f75109d6ce0c99bbe90 | missing |\n| \"Table 8\" | 3d23d775aa7aaba28a07e196420a921a766ebdb6de5733910faed81a00daff60 | missing |\n| \"Table 9\" | bba0c96fef7a7c50df4af1263ddcf7390cbe0614434112b6edf878b00cf94bc7 | missing |\n| \"Table 10\" | 422b7ec94d3140dd060898d37c734a5144133bc9f05aa0107c01573ebff2179e | missing |\n| \"Table 11\" | 5aa54820703915b213eb4e25e81c1696ce3c2413e0f70cc946938547559fb935 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- A normalized copy of this workbook exists (13031bceb80730548ebcbb6a9074724ebafed087f841b9eecb99afc7aaee210c). Layout should match.\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
